%F A070705 a(n) = A051451(n) (mod A000961(n+1)) = A051126(A051451(n), A000961(n+1)). [Corrected by _Qiyuan Gu_, Sep 07 2026]
%e A070705 The case n=8 implies a(8) = A051451(8) (mod A000961(9)) = lcm(1,2,3,4,5,7,8,9) (mod 11) = 2520 (mod 11) = 1. [Corrected by _Qiyuan Gu_, Sep 07 2026]
